    signal: 'One of the widest pay bands on this list, driven heavily by company type, not just skill level',
  },
  {
    skill: 'UX/UI or product designer',
    fresher: 'Rs 2.5-6 LPA, Rs 5-7 LPA in metros with a strong portfolio',
    midSenior: 'Grows sharply with a proven case-study portfolio and product-thinking skill, not just tool fluency',
    signal: 'Fluency in Figma alone rarely moves the needle; research and interaction-design judgment is the scarce layer',
  },
  {
    skill: 'Full-stack developer',
